              "tweet_ids": [
                9
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2a.3",
              "text": "By 16:24 on Sep 9, government sources reiterated that Halvern Dam was damaged and provided information about the situation.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                18
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2a.4",
              "text": "At 17:00 on Sep 9, NGOs confirmed the dam had been damaged.",
