              "tweet_ids": [
                21
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2a.6",
              "text": "At 09:14 on Sep 10, a mandatory evacuation was ordered for Brindlemark and Ferris Hollow, with alert level raised to Orange.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                32
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2a.7",
              "text": "At 09:20 on Sep 10, media reported that roughly 11,800 residents were evacuated from Brindlemark and Ferris Hollow with alert level raised to Orange.",
